# Dynamic source converts into a fixed constrained array

Verifies an element read through a dynamic index is converted from centimeters
to the declared millimeter subtype before entering `int64<mm>[]` storage.

>>> source
let source: int[] = [2cm]
let index = 0
let sizes: int64<mm>[] = [source[index]]
print(sizes[0])

<<< stdout
20mm

<<< stderr
